{"unit_id":"tag:09WY:prose-0006","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n位点（site）<MATH_0001>，见注记 <REF_0001>，上还有第二个拓扑（topology）。具体而言，给定对象（object）<MATH_0002>，可以考虑所有覆盖（coverings）<MATH_0003>，覆盖 <MATH_0004> 的，使得 <MATH_0005> 为开浸入（open immersion）。将此位点（site）记为 <MATH_0006>。恒等（identity）函子（functor）<MATH_0007> 是连续（continuous）的，定义态射（morphism），在位点（sites）之间，\n<MATH_0008>。\n见第 <REF_0002> 节。对 Hausdorff 且局部拟紧（quasi-compact）的拓扑空间（topological space）<MATH_0009>，更确切地说，对 <MATH_0010>，将诱导的态射（morphism）记为\n<MATH_0011>\n（见《位点（Sites）》引理 <REF_0003>）。设 <MATH_0012> 为位点（site），其对象（objects）是 <MATH_0013> 的开集（opens），见《位点（Sites）》例 <REF_0004>。存在态射（morphism），在位点（sites）之间，\n<MATH_0014>，\n由连续（continuous）函子（functor）<MATH_0015>、<MATH_0016> 给出。具体而言，<MATH_0017> 有纤维积（fibre products）和终对象（final object），上面的函子（functor）与这些构造交换（commutes），故《位点（Sites）》命题 <REF_0005> 适用。经常将 <MATH_0018> 视为拓扑斯的态射（morphism of topoi）\n<MATH_0019>，\n利用等式（equality）<MATH_0020>。\n\n","allowed_english":["Hausdorff"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"identity","target_term":"恒等"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"opens","target_term":"开集"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"functor","ta